<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="557578708"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1800144456"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="一百遍"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="季彦霖 / 箱子"/><amll:meta key="album" value="一百遍"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:30.005"><div begin="00:00.240" end="03:30.005"><p begin="00:00.240" end="00:00.490" itunes:key="L1">一百遍 - 季彦霖</p><p begin="00:00.490" end="00:00.670" itunes:key="L2">词：箱子君</p><p begin="00:00.670" end="00:00.850" itunes:key="L3">曲：箱子君</p><p begin="00:00.850" end="00:01.070" itunes:key="L4">编曲：箱子君</p><p begin="00:01.070" end="00:01.360" itunes:key="L5">和声编写：箱子君</p><p begin="00:01.360" end="00:01.650" itunes:key="L6">和声配唱：箱子君</p><p begin="00:01.650" end="00:01.900" itunes:key="L7">录音师：卢晓武</p><p begin="00:01.900" end="00:02.150" itunes:key="L8">混音师：卢晓武</p><p begin="00:02.150" end="00:02.370" itunes:key="L9">制作人：李晨</p><p begin="00:02.370" end="00:02.630" itunes:key="L10">母带工程师：Clarence</p><p begin="00:02.630" end="00:02.870" itunes:key="L11">制作公司：Clever Music</p><p begin="00:02.870" end="00:03.050" itunes:key="L12">封面：牛牛</p><p begin="00:03.050" end="00:03.240" itunes:key="L13">文案：翠翠</p><p begin="00:03.240" end="00:30.730" itunes:key="L14">出品人：王婷婷</p><p begin="00:30.730" end="00:31.820" itunes:key="L15">男：</p><p begin="00:31.820" end="00:35.460" itunes:key="L16">雨停 我心已放晴</p><p begin="00:35.460" end="00:39.200" itunes:key="L17">等你 约你看风景</p><p begin="00:39.200" end="00:43.090" itunes:key="L18">我不会太多言语</p><p begin="00:43.090" end="00:47.400" itunes:key="L19">只会傻傻的想你</p><p begin="00:47.400" end="00:51.180" itunes:key="L20">安静的听 这旋律</p><p begin="00:51.180" end="00:55.050" itunes:key="L21">为你谱写一首曲</p><p begin="00:55.050" end="00:58.890" itunes:key="L22">歌词也许不动心</p><p begin="00:58.890" end="01:02.260" itunes:key="L23">但写的都是情</p><p begin="01:02.260" end="01:02.570" itunes:key="L24">女：</p><p begin="01:02.570" end="01:04.500" itunes:key="L25">都说了一百遍</p><p begin="01:04.500" end="01:06.500" itunes:key="L26">爱你我不会变</p><p begin="01:06.500" end="01:08.450" itunes:key="L27">多信任一点点</p><p begin="01:08.450" end="01:10.430" itunes:key="L28">才能走的长远</p><p begin="01:10.430" end="01:12.270" itunes:key="L29">我相信这感觉</p><p begin="01:12.270" end="01:14.660" itunes:key="L30">那感觉已明确</p><p begin="01:14.660" end="01:17.520" itunes:key="L31">不用太多的语言</p><p begin="01:17.520" end="01:20.350" itunes:key="L32">喔喔喔 一百遍</p><p begin="01:20.350" end="01:22.310" itunes:key="L33">我有一点迷恋</p><p begin="01:22.310" end="01:24.150" itunes:key="L34">我相信这感觉</p><p begin="01:24.150" end="01:26.160" itunes:key="L35">我一定不会变</p><p begin="01:26.160" end="01:30.700" itunes:key="L36">我手心的空缺</p><p begin="01:30.700" end="01:49.310" itunes:key="L37">我希望能与你永远</p><p begin="01:49.310" end="01:50.450" itunes:key="L38">男：</p><p begin="01:50.450" end="01:54.110" itunes:key="L39">安静的听 这旋律</p><p begin="01:54.110" end="01:57.790" itunes:key="L40">为你谱写一首曲</p><p begin="01:57.790" end="02:02.050" itunes:key="L41">歌词也许不动心</p><p begin="02:02.050" end="02:05.440" itunes:key="L42">但写的都是情</p><p begin="02:05.440" end="02:05.830" itunes:key="L43">女：</p><p begin="02:05.830" end="02:07.560" itunes:key="L44">都说了一百遍</p><p begin="02:07.560" end="02:09.480" itunes:key="L45">爱你我不会变</p><p begin="02:09.480" end="02:11.370" itunes:key="L46">多信任一点点</p><p begin="02:11.370" end="02:13.360" itunes:key="L47">才能走的长远</p><p begin="02:13.360" end="02:15.040" itunes:key="L48">我相信这感觉</p><p begin="02:15.040" end="02:17.580" itunes:key="L49">那感觉已明确</p><p begin="02:17.580" end="02:20.260" itunes:key="L50">不用太多的语言</p><p begin="02:20.260" end="02:23.250" itunes:key="L51">喔喔喔 一百遍</p><p begin="02:23.250" end="02:25.270" itunes:key="L52">我有一点迷恋</p><p begin="02:25.270" end="02:27.190" itunes:key="L53">我相信这感觉</p><p begin="02:27.190" end="02:29.160" itunes:key="L54">我一定不会变</p><p begin="02:29.160" end="02:33.600" itunes:key="L55">我手心的空缺</p><p begin="02:33.600" end="02:37.520" itunes:key="L56">我希望能与你永远</p><p begin="02:37.520" end="02:38.980" itunes:key="L57">都说了一百遍</p><p begin="02:38.980" end="02:40.920" itunes:key="L58">爱你我不会变</p><p begin="02:40.920" end="02:42.870" itunes:key="L59">多信任一点点</p><p begin="02:42.870" end="02:44.860" itunes:key="L60">才能走的长远</p><p begin="02:44.860" end="02:46.440" itunes:key="L61">我相信这感觉</p><p begin="02:46.440" end="02:48.780" itunes:key="L62">那感觉已明确</p><p begin="02:48.780" end="02:51.670" itunes:key="L63">不用太多的语言</p><p begin="02:51.670" end="02:54.680" itunes:key="L64">喔喔喔 一百遍</p><p begin="02:54.680" end="02:56.700" itunes:key="L65">我有一点迷恋</p><p begin="02:56.700" end="02:58.610" itunes:key="L66">我相信这感觉</p><p begin="02:58.610" end="03:00.570" itunes:key="L67">我一定不会变</p><p begin="03:00.570" end="03:05.090" itunes:key="L68">我手心的空缺</p><p begin="03:05.090" end="03:30.005" itunes:key="L69">我希望能与你永远</p></div></body></tt>